#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:761
msgid "Legal Framework and Applicable Standards"
msgstr "Juridisch kader en toepasselijke standaarden"

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:763
msgid ""
"This statement is prepared in compliance with Directive (EU) 2016/2102 on "
"the accessibility of the websites and mobile applications of public sector "
"bodies, as implemented by national legislation, and with the model "
"established by EU Implementing Decision 2018/1523. The technical "
"requirements are based on the harmonised standard EN 301 549 v3.2.1, which "
"incorporates Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, Level AA."
msgstr ""
"Deze verklaring is opgesteld in overeenstemming met Richtlijn (EU) 2016/2102 "
"inzake de toegankelijkheid van de websites en mobiele applicaties van "
"overheidsinstanties, zoals geïmplementeerd door nationale wetgeving, en het "
"model vastgesteld door EU-uitvoeringsbesluit 2018/1523. De technische "
"vereisten zijn gebaseerd op de geharmoniseerde norm EN 301 549 v3.2.1."

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:766
#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:832
msgid "Legal basis:"
msgstr "Rechtsgrondslag:"

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:768
