msgid "Known limitations:"
msgstr "Bekende beperkingen:"

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:955
msgid ""
"Pre-recorded time-based media (audio/video) published before 28 June 2025."
msgstr ""
"Vooraf opgenomen tijdgebaseerde media (audio/video) gepubliceerd vóór 28 "
"juni 2025."

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:956
msgid ""
"Office file formats (PDF, DOCX, XLSX) published before 28 June 2025 and not "
